.It
text\-block \-i example1.txt \-b \[aq]<BEGIN\-BLOCK>\[aq] \-e \[aq]<END\-BLOCK>\[aq] \-\-replace insert.txt \-\-include\-tags \-\-full\-tag\-lines
.It
